      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-09T16:44:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027ll simplify subclasses if `renderPassBounds` is also translated by the viewport translation so that it\u0027s in the coordinate space of the color texture and not the resolve texture.",
