      "writtenOn": "2025-05-09T16:44:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is an implicit assumption that the logical rendering pipeline (and NDC) definition is (0,0,viewW, viewH), so I think viewportTranslation being renamed as the offsetBetweenColorTexture and resolve texture origins would be clearer that this is a shift that shouldn\u0027t be visible to the vertex shader.",
